<title>USA: Medicis completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Medicis completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medicis Pharmaceutical Corp on Tuesday said it has completed its acquisition of prescription topical steroids Lidex and Synalar from Syntex (U.S.A.) Inc and affiliates.</p>
<p>The deal had been valued at closure of the sale at up to $31 million in cash, Medicis said in a statement.</p>
<p>Medicis said it will begin marketing Lidex and Synalar to dermatologists nationwide immediately.</p>
<p>Syntex is a unit of Roche Holding Ltd.</p>
</text>
